    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"This CD ROM contains an overview of a Workshop and Field Trips held on September 14-28, 2002 in Hungary. The Seminar/Workshop attracted a broad spectrum of knowledgeable and interested attendees.  Preliminary records indicate that 45 people attended all or part of the three-day sessions. Eighteen attended both the sessions in Budapest and in Pécs, 16 attended only in Budapest and 11 attended only in Pécs.  Five attendees represented academia, 20 had government affiliation, 19 were from industry, and 1 from a trade union.\"",
